@alloc_VA
choose-if: South_army_strength >= 5 and (VA_occupation || 0) < occupation
unavailable-subtitle: [? if South_army_strength < 5 : Not enough troops in the Southern theater to spare. ?][? if (VA_occupation || 0) >= occupation : Federal law does not currently authorize a stronger presence than Congress has approved nationally. ?]
on-arrival: South_army_strength -= 5; VA_occupation = (VA_occupation || 0) + 1
go-to: allocate_troops

Federal troops already committed to the Southern theater are redirected to reinforce the garrison in Virginia.

