@withdraw_troops
title: Withdraw troops from a state.

- @withdraw_VA: Virginia
- @withdraw_NC: North Carolina
- @withdraw_SC: South Carolina
- @withdraw_GA: Georgia
- @withdraw_AL: Alabama
- @withdraw_FL: Florida
- @withdraw_MS: Mississippi
- @withdraw_AR: Arkansas
- @withdraw_TX: Texas
- @withdraw_LA: Louisiana
- @withdraw_TN: Tennessee
- @root: Return to main

@withdraw_VA
choose-if: (VA_occupation || 0) >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: There is no federal garrison in Virginia to withdraw.
on-arrival: VA_occupation -= 1; South_army_strength += 2
go-to: withdraw_troops

Troops are pulled back from Virginia and redirected to the broader Southern theater, though redeployment costs some of their effective strength.

